From f7ae24d01e930e87cf9b2fc461744b6357a5093c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: PyVerse <dev@pyverse.invalid>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 11:39:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Practice: run Python in a killable worker, Python Tutor-style
 trace UI, site-shell fixes

Freeze: Run/Submit/Trace ran Pyodide on the page's main thread, so
`while True: pass` froze the tab and nothing could stop it. Python now runs in a
Web Worker (static/js/pyverse-runner.js) behind a watchdog
(static/js/pyverse-runtime.js): a call over its budget (Run 5 s, Submit 10 s,
Trace 8 s) is killed, the worker restarts, and the page gets a normal-looking
"Time limit exceeded" result. The grader and tracer Python are NOT ported: the
templates ship them as inert <script type="py"> text (embedded=True drops
PyScript) and the worker runs that same text behind a small DOM shim; a test
pins the shim to what the Python actually touches.

Tracer UI: replace the Labs-engine panel on the problem page with a Python
Tutor-style step-through (static/js/tutor-view.js): code with just-ran / runs-next
arrows, print output, Frames (global + every active call, current highlighted,
return values) and Objects (lists, dicts, instances drawn once, with pointer
arrows), First/Back/Forward/Last + slider + keyboard. The tracer now records
steps[].stack (each frame with its line), a `final` state, and (problem path
only) the program's functions. Labs output is unchanged.

Pages: .pe-on-light re-pointed the palette with Tailwind arbitrary classes that
only beat .pe-engine when Tailwind's CSS loaded last; with the other order
Practice / Sheets went near-black with white text on cream cards. The same
tokens are now one two-class rule in practice-engine.css. Notes (/python/notes/)
were Puput's Bootstrap theme (white page, blue bars, no navbar); they now extend
home/base_.html with a scoped stylesheet in the site palette.

Tests: 71 pass (+20). Verified in headless Chromium against real Pyodide:
runaway loop keeps the page responsive, is reported, runtime restarts, Submit
works again; accepted / wrong-answer / crash flows open the right trace.
